#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to use and build Qiskit Function templates."
msgstr "Alamin kung paano gamitin at buuin ang mga Qiskit Function template."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Function templates"
msgstr "Panimula sa mga Qiskit Function template"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to Qiskit Function templates {#introduction-to-qiskit-function-"
"templates}"
msgstr ""
"Panimula sa mga Qiskit Function template {#introduction-to-qiskit-function-"
"templates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit Function templates](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-"
"function-templates) are an open-source collection of realistic code examples"
" that give you access to some of the latest research workflows that leverage"
" tools like the Qiskit SDK and [Qiskit addons](/guides/addons). These pre-"
"built workflows take information from practical experiments and package them"
" in a way that you can customize and reuse in your own research so that you "
"don't have to build from scratch. All templates are readily deployable to "
"[Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless) where you can easily leverage "
"classical compute as part of your workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [mga Qiskit Function template](https://github.com/qiskit-"
"community/qiskit-function-templates) ay isang open-source na koleksyon ng "
"mga makatotohanang halimbawa ng code na nagbibigay sa iyo ng access sa ilan "
"sa mga pinakabagong research workflow na gumagamit ng mga tool tulad ng "
"Qiskit SDK at [mga Qiskit addon](/guides/addons). Ang mga pre-built na "
"workflow na ito ay kumukuha ng impormasyon mula sa mga praktikal na "
"eksperimento at inilalagay ang mga ito sa isang paraan na maaari mong "
"i-customize at gamitin muli sa iyong sariling research nang hindi na "
"kailangang magsimula mula sa wala. Lahat ng template ay madaling ma-deploy "
"sa [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless) kung saan madali mong magagamit "
"ang classical compute bilang bahagi ng iyong workflow.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are two types of templates:\n"
msgstr "Mayroong dalawang uri ng template:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Template implementations*: Specialized code examples that implement "
"advanced techniques from real-world experiments in areas like chemistry and "
"physics.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Mga template implementation*: Mga espesyalisadong halimbawa ng code na "
"nagpapatupad ng mga advanced na teknik mula sa mga totoong eksperimento sa "
"mga larangan tulad ng chemistry at physics.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Base templates*: References for developing your own original Qiskit "
"Function. These templates highlight best-practices in interface development,"
" code formatting, unit testing, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Mga base template*: Mga sanggunian para sa pagbuo ng iyong sariling "
"orihinal na Qiskit Function. Itinatampok ng mga template na ito ang mga "
"pinakamahusay na gawi sa interface development, pag-format ng code, unit "
"testing, at iba pa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Template implementations {#template-implementations}"
msgstr "Mga template implementation {#template-implementations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Function template implementations are organized by application area. Currently included in the collection is a physics template for Hamiltonian simulation using the [AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/) and a chemistry template for electronic structure with the implicit solvent model using the [SQD Qiskit addon](/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd).\n"
"Resources to get started with these two templates are available at the following links:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga Qiskit Function template implementation ay inayos ayon sa application area. Kasalukuyang kasama sa koleksyon ang isang physics template para sa Hamiltonian simulation gamit ang [AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/) at isang chemistry template para sa electronic structure na may implicit solvent model gamit ang [SQD Qiskit addon](/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd).\n"
"Ang mga mapagkukunan para makapagsimula sa dalawang template na ito ay makikita sa mga sumusunod na link:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Electronic structure simulation with implicit solvent model: [template "
"source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) and [guide](/guides/function-"
"template-chemistry-workflow)\n"
msgstr ""
"Electronic structure simulation na may implicit solvent model: [mga source "
"file ng template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) at [gabay](/guides/function-template-"
"chemistry-workflow)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Hamiltonian simulation: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-"
"community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) and "
"[guide](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"
msgstr ""
"Hamiltonian simulation: [mga source file ng "
"template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) at "
"[gabay](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Base templates {#base-templates}"
msgstr "Mga base template {#base-templates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *base templates* are references for developing your own original Qiskit "
"Function. They are designed to help you kickstart the development process by"
" illustrating best practices in interface development, code formatting, I/O "
"handling, error messages, checkpoints, unit testing, and more. The "
"repository is exposed as a [GitHub "
"template](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-"
"repositories/creating-a-template-repository) so that the CI/CD "
"implementation can be easily extended.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga *base template* ay mga sanggunian para sa pagbuo ng iyong sariling "
"orihinal na Qiskit Function. Idinisenyo ang mga ito para mapabilis mo ang "
"pagsisimula ng proseso ng development sa pamamagitan ng pagpapakita ng mga "
"pinakamahusay na gawi sa interface development, pag-format ng code, paghawak"
" ng I/O, mga mensahe ng error, mga checkpoint, unit testing, at iba pa. Ang "
"repository ay ibinibigay bilang isang [GitHub "
"template](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-"
"repositories/creating-a-template-repository) para madaling mapalawak ang "
"CI/CD implementation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are currently two templates: a [circuit function "
"template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) and an "
"[application function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-"
"function-"
"templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kasalukuyang mayroong dalawang template: isang [circuit function "
"template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-"
"templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) at isang "
"[application function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-"
"function-"
"templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"

